<Button Content="Choose cache folder" Click="ChooseShaderCacheFolder_Click" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
<TextBlock Text="Leave empty to use _PipelineCache beside kyty_emulator.exe. The cache is generated during gameplay and reused on later runs; this build has no standalone shader pre-compilation step. A custom folder requires the maintained patched KytyPS5 build. Existing caches are never moved or deleted by this setting. GPU-driver caches and shader debug logs are separate."/>
</StackPanel></GroupBox>
<Label Content="Additional Arguments" Target="{Binding ElementName=AdditionalArgumentsBox}" Foreground="White"/>
<TextBox x:Name="AdditionalArgumentsBox" Text="{Binding AdditionalArguments, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" AutomationProperties.Name="Additional Arguments"/>
<TextBlock Text="Quote paths containing spaces with double quotes. The game path is supplied automatically. Managed flags cannot also appear here while structured settings are enabled." TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
<Label Content="Effective options preview" Target="{Binding ElementName=ArgumentsPreviewBox}" Foreground="White"/>
<TextBox x:Name="ArgumentsPreviewBox" Text="{Binding ArgumentsPreview, Mode=OneWay}" IsReadOnly="True" TextWrapping="Wrap" AutomationProperties.Name="Effective options preview"/>
<TextBlock Text="{Binding ArgumentsValidation}" Foreground="#FCA5A5" TextWrapping="Wrap" AutomationProperties.LiveSetting="Assertive"/>
<TextBlock Text="{Binding ArgumentsSaveState}" TextWrapping="Wrap" AutomationProperties.LiveSetting="Polite"/>
<Button x:Name="ApplyArgumentsButton" Style="{StaticResource SettingsPrimaryButton}" Content="Apply arguments" Click="ApplyArguments_Click" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
</StackPanel></GroupBox><GroupBox Header="shadPS4 (PS4)"><StackPanel><TextBlock Text="Experimental PS4 emulation; game compatibility varies. Use game dumps and firmware modules from your own console." TextWrapping="Wrap"/><TextBlock Text="shadPS4 executable"/><DockPanel LastChildFill="True"><Button Content="Choose shadPS4 executable" Click="ChooseShadPS4_Click" IsEnabled="{Binding CanManageShadPS4}" DockPanel.Dock="Right"/><TextBox x:Name="ShadPS4PathBox" Text="{Binding ShadPS4Path, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus, ValidatesOnExceptions=True}" IsEnabled="{Binding CanManageShadPS4}" AutomationProperties.Name="shadPS4 executable path"/></DockPanel><Border Style="{StaticResource SettingsStatusBadge}"><DockPanel><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="ⓘ" Foreground="#80D5FF" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsHitTestVisible="False"/><TextBlock Text="{Binding ShadPS4Availability}" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></DockPanel></Border><WrapPanel><Button Content="Test availability" Click="TestShadPS4_Click" IsEnabled="{Binding CanManageShadPS4}"/><CheckBox Content="Start full screen" IsChecked="{Binding ShadPS4Fullscreen}" Foreground="White" Margin="8,0"/></WrapPanel></StackPanel></GroupBox></StackPanel></ScrollViewer></TabItem>
